window.products.push({"id":836096,"name":"Wicker Woven Floating Shelves Metal Brackets | Rustic Wall Hanging Storage Racks , Living Room Magazine & Book Shelves - Bathroom Over the Toilet Shel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5wuL3FUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗩𝗘𝗥𝗦𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗟𝗘 𝗪𝗔𝗟𝗟 𝗦𝗧𝗢𝗥𝗔𝗚𝗘 𝗦𝗛𝗘𝗟𝗩𝗘𝗦- These hanging shelves with stainless brackets can not only be used as toiletry rack or towel shelf in the bathroom but can also be used as spice shelves, tool shelves in the kitchen; CD & DVD organizer in the living room or display shelf for small ornaments in the hallway as well as reading room. Thanks to the sizes, they are ideal choices for various wall storage purposes 𝐑𝐔𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐂 𝐁𝐄𝐀𝐔𝐓𝐘 - MadeTerra Wall Hanging Racks are made with the combination of uitility and aesthetic. The natural rattan color, basic metal back with eye-catching pattern give the shelf baskets outstanding look. They fit perfectly with multiple home decor style, from farmhouse, primitive, country to minimalism and modern. This set adds a character and a touch of natural beauty to the space 𝗦𝗧𝗨𝗥𝗗𝗬 & 𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝗧𝗢 𝗜𝗡𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗟𝗟- Our rattan wall storage racks are crafted carefully by skilled artisans, giving them the highest possible quality. The shelf baskets are durable, light- weighted and made to last a long time in use. Thanks to the delicate metal brackets, our baskets are easily hung: you could choose to wall-mounted them with screw or use sticky hooks without drilling. Either way, the shelves stay stable and sturdy on your wall. 𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗙𝗘𝗖𝗧 𝗦𝗜𝗭𝗘𝗦- This floating wood and metal shelf is sized sophisticatedly. The shelf basket is 15.7\" x 11.8\"x 4.7\". Each basket is large in width, giving them high storage capacity. They are great choices for above-the-window shelving solutions, book storage or accessories racks. 𝗬𝗢𝗨𝗥 𝗣𝗨𝗥𝗖𝗛𝗔𝗦𝗘 𝗠𝗔𝗞𝗘𝗦 𝗔𝗡 𝗜𝗠𝗣𝗔𝗖𝗧- MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This set of 3 primitive hanging shelves, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Vietnamese local Villages. With every purchase you make, you are helping us make a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5wuL3FUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08FM9ZMNR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FM9ZMNR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FM9ZMNR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836097,"name":"colsen Fireplace Fuel, Ventless, Bio-Ethanol, Clean Burning/Eco-Friendly (1000mL /32 oz.) - (Each) (1L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lWoNK6UHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Colsen pure bio-ethanol fuel for ventless fireplaces is your best choice for both indoor and outdoor use. It is the cleanest burning smokeless fireplace fuel on earth. Colsen was created especially for indoor ventless fireplaces and is completely 'Planet-Friendly'. It is a clean, sustainable bio-ethanol fuel specially formulated to provide the most beautiful fire possible while complying with all regulations required by U.S. Government agencies. The only by-products created when burning Colsen fuel are water vapor and very small amounts of carbon dioxide, similar to human breath. No toxins or offensive fumes are emitted while it burns - the flame is clean and odorless. Colsen burns efficiently and there is no oily residue left in the tank to clean up as with other bio-ethanol fuels which contain petroleum distillates. Colsen is the ONLY fuel on the market with exclusive SAFETY-POUR technology - which provides the safest possible flash-free transfer of fuel from the bottle to the fireplace tank. Colsen burns with an interesting dancing yellow flame with orange and blue accents and lasts longer than any other alcohol fuel on the market. It has the lively look and warmth of a real wood fire, without any soot... or guilt from burning a fuel made from food. It's overwhelming bitter taste helps prevent accidental ingestion by children and small animals. No soot, no smoke, no smell, and no residue. The only recycled ethanol fuel available, making it the world's 'Greenest Choice Ethanol'.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lWoNK6UHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"colsen","source_asin":"B0BBSGG181","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBSGG181","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBSGG181","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
