window.products.push({"id":836221,"name":"ZipLock Bag Container Organizer - Sandwich Bag Organizer for Drawer Fits All Food Storage Bags - Space Saving Baggie Kitchen Organizer With an Acrylic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81In8IXcvaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of rifling through a drawer or pantry trying to find the food storage bag that you need? Wouldn’t it be awesome if you could stylishly organize all of these food storage bags and create more space in your kitchen? We’ll go out on a limb and assume that you’re nodding your head in agreement right now. If so, you need to get your hands on this BAG-E-BOX, Modern Food Storage Bag Container Organizer! Our kitchen drawer organizer for food storage bags will be your new favorite household accessory, here’s why: - Will help you get & stay organized while creating more space - Beautiful craftsmanship with a white acrylic base & wooden top - Labeled compartments designed to fit all size sandwich bags - Measures 11.73 x 11.73 x 3 inches - fits in most drawers - The bottom has rubber feet that prevent it from moving around - There's no removable lid, so you can get the baggies in & out with ease - Makes a great gift idea that's sure to be put to good use Let me give you a little background about the inspiration behind this eye-catching plastic baggie organizer. I consider myself a very organized person and am always looking to make my home cleaner and tidier. Although, I always struggle to find products that fit my style. I like modern, clean, minimalistic pieces. Since I couldn’t find a food storage bag container organizer that struck my fancy, I decided to create one. This food storage bag organizer mixes simple, clean colors with beautiful wood. It’s the perfect organizer in and out of the drawer. So, are you finally ready to address your food storage bag mess? Click the Add to Cart button above and organize all of those bags in a stylish, practical way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81In8IXcvaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAG-E-BOX","source_asin":"B09GZP13M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GZP13M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GZP13M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836222,"name":"Irvint & Co Set of 2 Individual Decoupage Paper Party Napkin FEATHERS Watercolor Decor Luncheon Napkins for a Birthday holiday, Wedding, Cocktail Part","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zmtFWZkkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Set of 2 Napkins FEATHERS (5\" x 5\")  These colorful printed napkins are the perfect party accessory and decoration for your special occasion (these are individual napkins, NOT packages). Suitable for children's birthdays, baby showers, flower themed parties, charities, fundraisers, family gatherings, and other celebrations.  Made of soft and highly absorbent, 3-ply tissue to ensure durability and comfort. Place them on your dining tables and bar tops to make sure your party guests will always have these practical serviettes close at hand.  Dress up your table everyday by adding a touch of elegance.  Our beautifully designed Cocktail Napkins make any setting a place where your guests will want to linger.  A must for your next wine and cheese party.  Our Paper Cocktail Napkins are printed in Germany using non-toxic, water-soluble dyes, making them biodegradable and compostable. Disposability makes clean-up a snap so you have more time to enjoy the party. Orders of 1 or 2 sets of napkins WILL BE folded to fit into a plastic sleeve to protect them from inclement weather. They will be mailed in a 5.75\" x 8.75\" greeting card sized envelope or a 6\" x 9\" poly envelope. Orders of 3 or more sets of napkins will NOT be folded. They will be inserted into a plastic sleeve & mailed in a 10\" x 13\" poly mailer to protect them from inclement weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zmtFWZkkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Irvint & Co","source_asin":"B09GNP4GZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GNP4GZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GNP4GZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
