window.products.push({"id":836231,"name":"Karl home 4-Tier Bookcase Storage Cabinet, Freestanding Bookshelf with 4 Acrylic Doors 1 Drawer, Kitchen Pantry Bathroom Cabinet for Office Bedroom Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T2T3r+n4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ample Storage Space】This tall wooden bookcase has 4 layers of storage cabinets and 1 drawer. Shelves on which the lockers are placed are adjustable. There is plenty of space for books, photos, documents, wine collections, plants, souvenirs and decorative crafts. 【Durable Material】This white bookcase with acrylic door is made of high quality MDF, which is strong and durable to hold all your belongings. The surface of the bookcase has a white coating, which is smooth and easy to clean. The drawers are equipped with slide rails for easy access. 【Simple Retro Design】4-layer white bookcase is minimalist. Transparent doors let you see what you want at a glance. The middle drawer can be used to store some small items. The modern look complements any of your home decor perfectly. 【Multi-purpose】This bookshelf is versatile and ideal for use as a bookcase for study, display cabinets for antiques and collectibles in the living room, filing cabinets in the office, self-service sideboards in the dining room and storage cabinets in the bathroom. 【Easy to Install & After-Sale Service】The locker needs to be installed, all parts and instructions are included in the package. The overall size is: 29.13\"L x 13.78\"W x 70.87\"H. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We will solve the problem within 24 hours and give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T2T3r+n4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karl home","source_asin":"B0C2HT851Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HT851Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HT851Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836232,"name":"CHUVIAN Home Foldable Tufted Linen Storage Ottoman Square Cube Foot Stool 43 Inches Cube Storage Ottoman, Comfortable Seat with Solid Wooden Feet and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p9iGc27FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Striking Storage Stools】 Modern grey and Chesterfield-inspired tufting on the comfy soft seat make this bench an eye-catcher in any room or living room. It has impressive features and a 660-pound load-carrying weight, at the same time, it has a premium fiberboard frame so you can sit on it with confidence. 【3-in-1 Functional Footrest】As you can see, it is used to place children's toys or snacks; at the same time, it can also be used as a footrest. When working from home, its role is to help you lift your feet and reduce the pressure on your back; Storage Ottoman is suitable for many places: Opposite the sofa in the living room? At the end of the bed in the bedroom? Or next to the closet in the hallway? Even your office? Your imagination is the only limit! 【Anti-dirty foot design】Different from other conventional 15-inch storage stools, we have adopted a different design, Add four wooden silent anti-dirt feet, reducing the contact between the bottom and the ground and avoiding damage to the fabric. Anti-slip pads on the soles of the feet provide you with comfort and safety at the same time. Plus, the mat avoids loud squeals, so it won't disturb your family's reading or work while you're on the move. 【Multiple storage options】 In your bedroom, you usually have a large cupboard for clothes, sheets, and boxes. However, when your old cabinets are full, this 55L storage bench gives you more storage space. The lower part of the bench folds flat and can be stored in a space-saving way if you're not using it, such as under a bed or on a cupboard shelf. 【Comfortable extension of the sofa】 Even if you won't be sitting on this bench for as long as the sofa, we still want to make sure you feel comfortable every minute you spend on it - That's why we use a 2\" thickened countertop instead of a regular 1\" countertop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p9iGc27FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUVIAN","source_asin":"B0B79YW1VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B79YW1VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B79YW1VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
