window.products.push({"id":836464,"name":"Hbada Gaming Desk 43.7 in Computer Desk Ergonomic Home Office Desk T-Shaped Racing Pro PC Gamer Desk with Full Cover Mousepad, Cup Holder and Headphon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE80Ra2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Full Cover Surface: 43.7”* 23.6”large desktop space with full cover soft mousepad, meets your need for double monitors, enough space for mouse movement and place a variety of your favorite gaming devices. Give you a stage to enjoy games Stable Framework: Thickened integrated T-shaped steel desk legs can afford more weight, and the adjustable leg pads makes the desk stable even on the uneven floor. Ergonomic Desgin: Headphone hook and cup hold free up desktop space, allows you to immerse yourself in the game and replenish energy anytime. Curved desk edge on your body side, can release the space around your abdomen Keep Desktop Clean and Tidy: The gaming desk come with double cable manage hole and exclusive power strip box, can help you free up a lot of desktop space. The carbon fiber texture surface, durable, water-proof and skid-resistance. Fast Assembly: Tools and instructions that needed are included in the package. can help you complete the installation easily in 30 minutes. And we provide one-year warranty for our products, if you find any problems , please feel free contact us and we will respond you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE80Ra2fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hbada","source_asin":"B08F7MLP53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7MLP53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7MLP53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836465,"name":"SEIKO Mika Compact and Lightweight Bedroom Alarm Clock, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ok-zgfQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Wake up to this compact, light-weight alarm clock. The design is functional and sophisticated with white bezel accents, a white face plate. The Arabic numbers and hands are luminous (get up and glow feature) and will stay visible for a short time after the lights are turned out. The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattori’s Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of world’s first technologies… transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch – changed the history of time. The first Kinetic – marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches –And Seiko technology firmly established today’s standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first – Kinetic Technology – powered by body movement. Kinetic – a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy –the driving force behind more world’s firsts. Kinetic Chronograph – the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay – automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive – move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation – A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ok-zgfQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B0BKSLJK5D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKSLJK5D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKSLJK5D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
