window.products.push({"id":836602,"name":"14' Pre-Lit Full Northern Pine Artificial Christmas Tree - Multi-Color Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1365.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qyiUBNbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features perfectly shaped tapered tips that are a medium green color and have a natural. lush look and feel. Product Features: Pre-lit with 1500 multi-color lights. Multi-color consists of red. green. blue. amber. pink and pink-purple bulbs. Bulb size: mini. 9962 tips. 1.75\" wide tips. Full profile tree. Flame retardant. Additional Product Features: Hinged branch construction. Light sets on tree are UL listed for indoor or outdoor use. however the tree itself is recommended for indoor use. If one bulb burns out. the rest will stay lit. Lights are equipped with Lamp Lock feature. which makes them replaceable. interchangeable and keeps them from falling out. Comes with replacement bulbs and spare fuses. Comes with a FREE black metal tree stand. Wire gauge: 22. Dimensions: 14' high (from the base of stand to the top of the tree). 88\" base diameter (at the widest point). Material(s): PVC/metal/glass bulbs/wire","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qyiUBNbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B00N0YD3YI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N0YD3YI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N0YD3YI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836603,"name":"Fair Trade Ghana Bolga African Gambibgo Pot 14-16\" Across, 44346","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oa5gasgDL._AC_.jpg","description":"You will receive a basket nearly identical to this one pictured, but please keep in mind every basket is uniquely handwoven and differs in design. Coming from Gambibgo village, in the Bolgatanga region of Ghana, these baskets are often used to store things in the home. This Gambibgo basket is unusual in that is has a swivel handle that folds down flat. Also, the appealing bulbous shape is more difficult to weave than a normal round basket. Weavers in the region use the abundant Veta Vera grass to weave these incredibly hardy, useful baskets. The leather wrapped handle adds to the durability. Please note that if color looks black on your screen, it is actually a very, very dark blue. Easily reshape your basket by quickly submerging in water, reshape by hand and hang to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oa5gasgDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B00T8HRH2U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T8HRH2U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T8HRH2U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836604,"name":"Enesco Jim Shore Legend of Christmas Key ORN Hanging Ornament, 5.75 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dORRfLouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jim Shore's handcrafted Heartwood Creek collection imparts a sense of hope and nostalgia, embracing inspiring themes of family, tradition, spirituality and patriotism. His designs are inspired by the time honored motifs of folk art and quilting. The Legend of this Magic Christmas Key ornament is an enchanting one. After all, not every house has a chimney but Santa still manages to get in somehow! The holiday season itself is a key that opens our lives to promise and our heart to Christmas. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dORRfLouL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B08V8JRMCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V8JRMCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V8JRMCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836605,"name":"Personalized Gifts 45th Anniversary Frame 45 Years and Counting Natural Wood Engraved 5x7 Portrait Picture Frame Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713spzUm1rL._AC_SL1259_.jpg","description":"A sentimental Sapphire Anniversary gift for your 45th anniversary. Made from real wood, this natural frame will have its own unique coloration and wood grain pattern. Therefore, product may vary slightly in appearance from image shown. Frame includes a glass front and can be displayed hanging or standing with built in hook and easel. This beautifully crafted picture frame is designed and engraved in the USA. You have chosen a 5 inch by 7 inch portrait (vertical) photo frame. Engraving and frame color may vary slightly, as each piece of wood is unique.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713spzUm1rL._AC_SL1259_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Gifts","source_asin":"B0C1PD46LN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1PD46LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1PD46LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836606,"name":"LULUSILK Mulberry Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 100 Pure Silk Pillow Case Cover 19 Momme with Hidden Zipper, Taupe, Standard Size, Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EDkIbWd7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Mulberry Silk ❤PREMIUM SILK LUXURY EXPERIENCE: Certificated by OEKO-TEX standard 100, our pillow cover takes Grade 6A mulberry silk as the raw material to create a safe, comfortable and luxury sleeping environment for you. Lying down on this smooth silky pillowcase, you will finally get you good night's sleep ❤ANTI AGING ANTI WRINKLE HYPOALLERGENIC: More moisture, less wrinkles. Compared with cotton pillowcases which can draw moisture out of your face, silk pillow case can help your skin stay hydrated. No more creases, no more fine lines, instead of waking up with a refreshed new skin every morning. And if you are struggled with acne or pimple or have a sensitive skin, our pillow case can be a game changer to help you prevent the breakout and have a clean healthy skin ❤BEAUTY with BRIGHT SMOOTH HAIR: Just like skin, moisture means a lot to hair. Lack of moisture, your hair will soon have a series of problems, like split ends, breakage and so on, especially when you have curly hair. Our silk pillow protector can retain moisture for your hair, and its soft smooth surface can decrease friction avoid tangles. Farewell, bed head, wild hair. Standing in front of the mirror is a beauty with shiny hair ❤TEMPERATURE REGULATOR: Cool in summer, warm in winter. A must-have for hot sleepers ❤EASY to CARE: Hand wash in cold water with gentle detergent and line dry. If you have sensitive skin or some skin problems, we suggest you to change your pillowcase weekly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EDkIbWd7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LULUSILK","source_asin":"B01DZT3SJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DZT3SJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DZT3SJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
