window.products.push({"id":836620,"name":"Tiokop Twin Size L-Shaped Loft Bed with Built-in Ladders, Slide and Safety Guard Rails, Wooden Low Loftbeds Frame for 2 Kids Teens, No Box Spring Need","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ujWUpH1OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This bed combines two loft beds, which can accommodate two people, with two built-in ladders for easy climbing; and it is equipped with a slide, which combines entertainment and practicality. This bed is made of pine wood and MDF material. It is strong and durable and can be used for many years. The simple modern design is suitable for different decoration styles. With this space-saving design and sturdy construction, this bed is meant to be your best addition to your bedroom. Weight & Dimensionsc Overall Product Dimension：118\"L x 80.3\"W x 43.3\"H Detail Product Dimension：Please refer to the Size image Package Dimension：Please refer to the Specification Overall Product Weight : 142LBS Weight Capacity : 175LBS Recommended Mattress Thickness: 6\" Specifications: Product Type：Loft Bed Size：Twin  Color：Espresso  Product material：Plywood+MDF+Pinewood Level of Assembly：Full Assembly Needed Box Spring Required：No Mattress Included ：No Number of Slats: Upper bed: 14 Warranty time：One Year（Manufacture Defect) Additional Tools Required ：All Tools Included Avoid power tools：Yes Country of Origin：Vietnam Feature: 1,Unique Quality Assurance: Made of solid pine wood and high quality MDF, this bed provides great stability, The slats are available compatible with each loft bed compatible with better weight capacity. With this space-saving design and sturdy construction, this bed is meant to be your best addition to your bedroom. 2,2 Loft Beds into 1: This L shaped bed features 2 loft beds,it could be used for over night friends , out-of-town guests or hosting your friends for a sleepover,perfect for limited space. There is enough space under the bed for small tables or toys, etc.  3,Loft Bed with Slide and Ladders: This wooden loft bed comes with a built-in spacious slide offering extra fun for your family and meet their interactive play needs. The 2 ladders are available in the corner for easy access to top bed. Notes: Manual measurement has been used,there may be some reasonable error. All the pictures are taken by actual samples, slight chromatic aberration may occur due to lighting or display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ujWUpH1OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiokop","source_asin":"B0BBN8NCDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBN8NCDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBN8NCDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
