window.products.push({"id":836717,"name":"ORFELD Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 8-in-1 Cordless Stick Vacuum with 11 LED Headlights, Strong Suction Hardwood Floor Vacuum, 35min Runtime, 1.5L Dust Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vSpBJbHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➠Newly Upgraded Brushless Motor➠➠ ORFELD VC818 cordless vacuum cleaner is built with the latest upgraded brushless motor, with the strongest suction power up to 22000Pa in MAX mode, which can instantly vacuum the dust and debris on the floor, suitable for deep cleaning carpets, hardwood and marble floors, etc. ➠Super Long Running Time➠➠ Cordless stick vacuum cleaner is equipped with 8-cell high-capacity battery pack, which can run for 35 minutes in Normal mode and 20 minutes in MAX mode. 2 suction modes can be switched freely to meet different cleaning needs, and one charge is enough to clean the whole house. ➠8 in 1 Vacuum Cleaner➠➠ Cordless vacuum package equipped with multiple suction head accessories and adjustable telescopic pole, can be assembled into a multifunctional handheld vacuum cleaner, easy to clean stairs, basements, car seats, sofa crevices, curtains and other places to achieve all-round cleaning. ➠Flexible Harge Brush Head and 11LDE Headlight➠➠ The hardwood floor vacuum's large floor brush makes cleaning more efficient than other vacuums, spending less time on cleaning tasks.11 The LED headlight and 180° rotatable floor brush head make it easy to clean under furniture and in dark corners without moving furniture. ➠5-Stage Fully Sealed Filtration System➠➠ The stick vacuum cleaner cordless fully sealed filtration system captures 100% of fine particles (>0.1μm) and 95% of ultra-fine particles (<0.1μm) and releases fresh air to prevent secondary air pollution, making it ideal for homes with children and pets. ➠Easy to Use and Clean➠➠ Wireless vacuum 1.5L large-capacity bin doesn't need to be emptied frequently, one button for quick emptying to avoid touching dust, and the cordless and lightweight design of the vacuum cleaner makes it easy and convenient to use. the HEPA filter is washable and reusable, and the separate base is easy to store and stow. ➠After-Sales Service and Maintenance➠➠ ORFELD is a company that has been focusing on developing vacuum cleaner technology for many years, all products are provided with 2 years warranty and 7*24h customer service. Clean the metal filter and HEPA filter regularly to prevent insufficient suction power.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vSpBJbHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORFELD","source_asin":"B09WK822D5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WK822D5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WK822D5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
