window.products.push({"id":836730,"name":"The WindBlocker | 30 Disposable Chafing Stands | Blocks The Wind | Fire Retardant Cardboard | Disposable | Reusable Chafers | Keeps Food Warm, Retains","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714LI8H6V1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're looking for a way to keep your food warm and delicious at your next outdoor event, our chafing dishes are the perfect solution. Our chafing dishes are designed to block the wind and keep your food at the perfect temperature, without the need for any open flames.  Our wind-blocking chafing dishes are perfect for outdoor events of all kinds, including weddings, parties, festivals, and more. They are easy to set up and use, and they are designed to keep your food warm and delicious for hours on end.  One of the main advantages of our wind-blocking chafing dishes is their ability to block the wind. This is important because wind can make a huge difference when it comes to keeping your food warm. Our chafing dishes are designed to keep the wind out, which means that your food will stay warm and delicious no matter what the weather is like.  Another advantage of our wind-blocking chafing dishes is their safety. Because there are no open flames involved, you don't have to worry about any safety hazards. This is particularly important if you have children or pets at your event, as it ensures that everyone stays safe and comfortable throughout the event.  Our wind-blocking chafing dishes are also very easy to use. They come with clear instructions on how to set them up and use them, and they are designed to be user-friendly. This means that you can focus on enjoying your event instead of worrying about the food.  In addition to their practical advantages, our wind-blocking chafing dishes are also very stylish. They come in a variety of designs and colors, so you can choose the one that best suits your event. Whether you're looking for something elegant and sophisticated or something fun and playful, we have the perfect chafing dish for you.  So why wait? Choose our wind-blocking chafing dishes for your next outdoor event and enjoy delicious, warm, and safe food for all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714LI8H6V1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WindBlocker","source_asin":"B0C7P7SZP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7P7SZP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7P7SZP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
