window.products.push({"id":836756,"name":"5 Gallon Mylar Bags for Food Storage, 10.2 Mil Stand-up Mylar Bags with 10 Single Sealed 2000CC Oxygen Absorbers & Labels for 5 Gallon Bucket Long Ter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LE2JFdafL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LORALOSA 5 GALLON MYLAR BAGS FOR FOOD STORAGE 【PRODUCT SPECIFICATION】 -20 Large Mylar Bags 5 Gallon Size 25.6\"x17.7\", 10.2 Mil thick -20 individually Sealed 2000cc Oxygen Absorbers -20 sticker labels for food storage 【FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS】 Q: How many oxygen absorbers do I need for a 5 gallon mylar bag? A: For 1-gallon bags, you should use 1-2 300cc oxygen absorbers. For 5-gallon bags you should use 5-7 300cc oxygen absorbers or 1 2000cc oxygen absorber. Q: Will oxygen absorbers create a vacuum? A: Oxygen absorbers alone will not be able to accomplish this as they only remove oxygen, which is roughly 20%of the air inside the bag. However, the goal should be not to get a perfect vacuum seal, but to remove the oxygen asthe remaining contents of the air will not affect the long-term storage life of your food. Q: Do you need to vacuum seal Mylar bags? A: If you are storing food that needs to be used frequently, LoraLosa zipper mylar bags are resealable. For long term food storage, seal your mylar bags with a clamshell heat sealer or an impact heat sealer. If you don't have one of those then a flat iron or hair straightener should work. Q: How long does food last in sealed Mylar bags? A: Many foods can last 25 years or longer when properly stored in mylar. While dozens of foods can be dehydrated and stored at home for the long term, dry goods do not have a uniform shelf-life. Q: What foods Cannot be stored in Mylar bags? A: Foods that Should NOT Be Packaged in Mylar Bag (with an Oxygen Absorber) Brown rice is high in oil content and has a short shelf life. Foods high in moisture or oil content such as raisins, nuts, granola, chocolate chips, cookies, and crackers are NOT good candidates for long-term storage in a Mylar bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LE2JFdafL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LoraLosa","source_asin":"B0B5FVYHS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FVYHS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FVYHS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
