window.products.push({"id":836805,"name":"EKO Eco-Fly Dual Compartment Trash Can with Stainless Steel Finish, 20L + 20L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NL72iMQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The vertical orientation of the eco-fly trash can allows it to fit in tighter spaces, and the stainless Split-Top panels require less clearance, thus permitting placement under most counters. The brushed stainless-steel finish is fingerprint resistant, so the clean lines stay tidy looking longer. The foot pedal mechanism operates as a cantilever, gently raising the lid when pressed. The soft close lid descends slowly and quietly with no slamming. There is also a patented \"easy Lock\" switch which when set holds the lid open for longer when required. This can has a hidden handle at the front coupled with built-in but not visible back wheels, so it is easy to move around. Two 20L (5.2 gallon) inner liners help you keep your recyclables separate from regular household waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NL72iMQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EKO","source_asin":"B01ICPWQWO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ICPWQWO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ICPWQWO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
