window.products.push({"id":836846,"name":"Swanson Beddings Pink-Purple Roses 100% Cotton Sheet Set : Fitted Sheet, Flat Sheet and Two Matching Pillowcases (California King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhy45oRKL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","description":"This luxury sheet set matches the duvet cover set. The whole set will brighten your bedroom. It’s made of high quality 100% cotton with 300 thread count. The set is eco-friendly, smooth, soft, beautiful and durable. Care instruction: Machine wash cold, separately with gentle cycle. Do not soak and bleach. Tumble dry with gentle cycle and no heat. Remove promptly. Warm iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zhy45oRKL._AC_SL1081_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swanson Beddings","source_asin":"B079LZF64N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079LZF64N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079LZF64N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":836847,"name":"North Mountain Supply Premium Fruit Wine Making Equipment & Ingredient Kit - 1 Gallon Economy Kit - 24 Pieces - Use Your Own Fruit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a1Mo8RFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Your Own Fruit Wine Enjoy the experience of creating your own wine from the comfort of your home with North Mountain Supply's 24 piece economy wine making starter kit. This economy kit is perfect for those looking to try a new style of wine and includes everything you need to ferment - simply supply the fruit, corks, corker, and wine bottles of your choice. Simple To Make With Step by Step Instructions Our wine making supplies come with simple step by step instructions so there's no guess work or wondering what's next. Our wine kit even comes with a recipe book with over 100 recipes to spark inspiration and give you ideas on fruit types and combinations. Wine fermentation isn't complicated and you don't need to be a professional vintner to do it. Just mix the ingredients, let the mixture ferment, rack and sweeten, bottle, and enjoy. Makes About 75 Bottles Our economy wine fermentation kit comes with a one gallon glass carboy, perfect for making approximately five bottles at a time. The homemade wine kit comes with enough additives to make 75 bottles of wine, so you can try several recipes per batch to see which fruit wine is your favorite. Our home brewing kit contains high quality ingredients including tannins, yeast, and enzymes, as well as a fermenting jug, hydrometer, and straining bag. Each packet of yeast can make up to 6 gallons of wine. We recommend using the entire packet after opening to ensure freshness, but it can be saved for future use by storing in the fridge. Choose Your Fruit and Wine Flavor Unlike most wine kits, you're able to choose your own fruit to make this delicious country style wine. Any fruit, fresh, canned, or pureed can be used for this wine making equipment kit. It's perfect for those looking to choose locally sourced, organic, or even homegrown fruit. Fruit wine can be made from a range of fruits including apples, blackberries, peaches, pears and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a1Mo8RFGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"North Mountain Supply","source_asin":"B08W1YJV49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W1YJV49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W1YJV49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
