window.products.push({"id":836969,"name":"2Pcs Hot Pot Fat Skimmer Spoons, RETON 4inch 304 Stainless Steel Fine Mesh Strainer with Long Handle for Oil Filter Skimming Grease and Foam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ue4i9LpVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This skimmer features a fine mesh scoop, filtering and sifting the smallest of ingredients like juice, flour, chocolate powder, frying food, noodles. Making it ideal for hot pot, sauces, gravies and vegetables. RETON hot pot fat skimmer spoon is an absolutely necessary tool for anyone who loves to cook and to eat healthy. Let your family enjoy healthy and delicious home cooking together!  Specification Material: 304 food grade stainless steel mesh+201 stainless steel handle. Size: 23.5cm/9.25\" length of the handle, 10cm/4\" in diameter of the mesh and thickness is 0.2cm/0.08\". Package Included: 2 x Stainless Steel Skimmer Spoons Sturdy & Safe Made from 304 high grade durable stainless steel with long handle, sturdy and no rust, no breakage, no wear after multiple uses and washing. Our skimming spoon guarantees firmness and stability while also guaranteeing your health: the hot pot skimmer spoon will not release toxic substances when you make food! Non-slip Handle The skimmer spoon has added very attractive sure-grip handle which makes the strainers very easy to hold. You can lift heavy food without worrying about slipping out of your hand. Willow Nail Weld & Super Fine Mesh 4-inch diameter mesh filter uses rivets to connect the handle and the wire filter to form a tight weave and strong structure without the risk of falling, suitable for filtering the smallest food, draining liquids and sieving spices. Easy to Clean & Saving Space The mesh strainer is easy to clean and can be used in a dishwasher, or hand washed with detergent and warm water. Each handle has a hanging loop at the end, which can be hung on the wall for easy storage and can also drain the water generated after cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ue4i9LpVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RETON","source_asin":"B07JD8VCLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-836969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JD8VCLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JD8VCLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
